0:00Z","followers":0,"following":0,"html_url":"https://github.com/lyuma","id":39946030,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjM5OTQ2MDMw","login":"lyuma","type":"User","owned_private_repos":0,"public_gists":0,"public_repos":0,"total_private_repos":0,"url":"https://api.github.com/users/lyuma"},"body":"Approved in meeting.\nWe discussed that the track cache improvements in #117030 can be done after this is merged.\n\nI'm happy with the benchmark. The benchmark is pretty comprehensive for the BlendTree, but we noticed there was no benchmark for the animation state machine. There may be more optimizations needed there, for example with state transitions.\n\nI'm also wondering if there might be some advantage in caching the animation list. Even with the new get_animation_list function, it is making a copy of the list each time.","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/116394#pullrequestreview-3909518646","pull_request_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/116394","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","submitted_at":"2026-03-07T19:59:24Z"}]